# Mausoleum Wanderer: "Sacrifice Mausoleum Wanderer: Counter target instant or sorcery spell unless its controller pays {X},
# where X is Mausoleum Wanderer's power." X is the power as it last existed (CR 608.2h), and a negative power makes X 0
# (CR 107.1b): Icy Reception makes the Wanderer -4/1, Bot2 pays {0}, and the Bolt resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mausoleum Wanderer
Island
Icy Reception
Island x13

